      47.85,
      368.17,
      539.91,
      415.24
    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby notified that the following Order issued by Honourable Minister of Finance, by virtue of the power vested inhim by Section 32 read with Section 22 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52) as amended from time to time, and publishedin the Extraordinary Gazette No. 1981/87 of 26.08.2016 to impose an Excise duty per litre of imported foreign liquoras follows with effect from 01.09.2016, was passed by Parliament on 10.12.2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      61.65,
      428.17,
      368.97,
      475.24
    ],
    "text": "(i) Foreign Malt LiquorRs.50.00(ii) Foreign WineRs. 100.00(iii) Any other Foreign LiquorRs. 200.00(which are not included in (i) and (ii) above)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
